From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Playport <dev@playport.invalid>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 23:33:02 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] nsiproxy: serve iOS adapter and IPv4/IPv6 route snapshots

Read link metadata with getifaddrs on iOS and decode Darwin route snapshots with bounds checks, compressed masks and scoped IPv6 gateways. Darwin IPv6 interface scopes are interface indices, not Linux address-class codes. Exclude removed/replaced interface identities from later snapshots and queries. Keep unsupported statistics and neighbour APIs unchanged.

Class: ios-port
Evidence: docs/evidence/2026-10-07-nsi-adapters.md
Offered-upstream: no; iOS one-process runtime integration
---
